# Pairs with FeatureOffInert. The tenant layer must be skipped the moment the
# flag is off, on that silo, with the rules left in place.
MODULE: EvaluatorIgnoresFlag
TARGET: FeatureOffInert
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the evaluator consults the tenant layer while the silo's flag is off
PERTURBS: Evaluate

--- FIND
        consulted == ~opMatch /\ flag[s] /\ tree.kind = "tenant"
--- REPLACE
        consulted == ~opMatch /\ tree.kind = "tenant"
--- END
